GoldenrodCity_Interior23_Text_WorkerF_1::
	.string "Oh, you collect POKéMON? My son\n"
	.string "BILL is an expert.\p"
	.string "He had to leave for the POKéMON\n"
	.string "CENTER in ECRUTEAK CITY.$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior23_Text_WorkerF_2::
	.string "I’m so glad to see my son again.$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior23_Text_Woman1::
	.string "Are you a trainer?\p"
	.string "My big brother BILL made the PC\n"
	.string "POKéMON storage system.$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior23_Text_Bill_1::
	.string "BILL: Hi, {PLAYER}\n"
	.string "Do us a favor and take this\l"
	.string "EEVEE.\p"
	.string "It came over when I was adjusting\n"
	.string "the trading system.\p"
	.string "Someone has to take care of it,\n"
	.string "but I don’t like being outside.\p"
	.string "Can I count on you to play with it,\n"
	.string "{PLAYER}?$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior23_Text_Bill_2::
	.string "Oh... Now what to do?$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior23_Text_Bill_3::
	.string "BILL: I used to experiment with a\n"
	.string "TELEPORTER.\p"
	.string "I ought to do a follow-up.$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior23_Text_Bill_4::
	.string "BILL: I knew it!\n"
	.string "Way to go hero!\p"
	.string "You’re the real deal, dude!\p"
	.string "OK, I’m counting on you. Take good\n"
	.string "care of it.$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior23_Text_Bill_5::
	.string "Whoa, wait. You can’t carry any\n"
	.string "more POKéMON.$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior23_Text_Bill_6::
	.string "{PLAYER} received EEVEE.$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior23_Text_Bill_7::
	.string "BILL: PROF.ELM claims EEVEE may\n"
	.string "evolve in new and unknown ways.$"
